@* The two web fonts, for the public layout and the admin layout. They are linked here, in the
   head, so the browser asks for them as soon as it reads it; imported from the combined
   stylesheet, they waited for that whole file first (PROJECT_STATE Section 3cn).
   The icon font is asked for at the one size, weight and grade icons.css uses, with fill on and
   off: 1.1 MB with every weight, 450 KB like this. A weight other than 400 now draws at 400.
   "block" keeps an icon hidden for the moment the font takes to arrive, where "swap" showed its
   name ("chevron_right") in its place and moved the page when the font came. *@
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,400,0..1,0&display=block" />
